    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 24px"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;
    </span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">discontinue
    or restrict the operations of any related-party transactions between the Company&#8217;s PRC subsidiaries and VIE; </span></td></tr>
  </table>
