2027. In addition, on April 20, 2014, Taizhou Zhongjin signed a lease agreement with the landlord to lease a factory building for&#160;<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c123" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeaseTermOfContract" id="ixv-11354">20&#160;years</ix:nonNumeric>,
