<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b><i>Ordinary
Shares</i></b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Upon
the incorporation of the Company,&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c63" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11704">20,000,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;ordinary shares were issued. On October 28, 2022, the original shareholders of
the Company surrendered&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c278" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zjyl:OrdinarySharesSurrendered" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11705">13,250,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;ordinary shares for no consideration. As a result, on a retrospective basis,&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c279" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11706"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c279" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11707"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c280" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11708"><ix:nonFraction contextRef="c280" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11709">6,750,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>&#160;ordinary
shares were issued and outstanding as of September 30, 2022 and 2021.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>&#160;</b></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
February 8, 2024, the Company formally executed a forward share split of its ordinary shares at a ratio of one pre-split ordinary share
to&#160;20&#160;post-split ordinary shares. After the share split, the authorized number of ordinary shares became&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c281" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11710">1,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction>,
increased from&#160;<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c282" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11711">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction>&#160;pre-split shares. The par value changed from $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c281" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-11712">0.001</ix:nonFraction>&#160;to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c282" decimals="5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" unitRef="usdPershares" id="ixv-11713">0.00005</ix:nonFraction>&#160;accordingly. The number
of shares and per-share data are presented herein have been retroactively adjusted to give effect to the share split.</span></p></ix:nonNumeric><div>

