shares to <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c288" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11725">6,827,383</ix:nonFraction> shares and reduce the number of issued and outstanding shares of Class B ordinary shares from <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c289" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-11726">20,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares
