pursuant to PRC statutory laws totaled $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StatutoryAccountingPracticesStatutoryCapitalAndSurplusBalance" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-11734">2,864,741</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StatutoryAccountingPracticesStatutoryCapitalAndSurplusBalance" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-11735">2,864,741</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, and total restricted net assets amounted to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c1" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetsNet" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-11736">2,959,128</ix:nonFraction>
and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c2" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AssetsNet" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-11737">2,959,128</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</span></p></ix:continuation><div>

