an aggregate number of Class A Ordinary Shares equal to ten percent (<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c292" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zjyl:AggregateSharePercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-11752">10</ix:nonFraction>%) of the Class A ordinary shares issued by the Company as asset
