</div><ix:continuation id="_SubsequentEventsTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On June 29, 2026, Taizhou Zhongjin entered
